{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"0b9a1eaa83ca2ad9b2c895741648e7cde10f6189","node_id":"C_kwDOULC1J9oAKDBiOWExZWFhODNjYTJhZDliMmM4OTU3NDE2NDhlN2NkZTEwZjYxODk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:26Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2974ff41ae44d04e9de9cd78b6bb9674d462673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-code-quality-skills/git/trees/c2974ff41ae44d04e9de9cd78b6bb9674d462673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-code-quality-skills/git/commits/0b9a1eaa83ca2ad9b2c895741648e7cde10f6189","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBDCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALg0QAKT5pQ+IBbf9cPSKg93Q+qhb\nPoESB9HfiXGqQnvZlcTkW3UfZgEOTIoV3qXwDnzZgNAURwfxmBJLlaLIwtrKvQFC\nqTplgXcWAndydvMkkz13ZyyIPf0gD7e3dUJdezuOV/WyTiNQOfIhA25OkefvSSxU\nWZBGtvGWu6Re7PKnX/QVYRyxgjAZ/qrKMcOxA3iYpOVHDnhbY4wpAx/RvRePn3U+\nSBp1+RlutJIM6qBtRUNb4JYBUwKIFoDi1rMeUMCjfxEMpeWoRbf2xq8UYe+sxm1c\n7aDamWj0KhgmwBT5V1m3PKTX1FpOuTntVawCVTAXBMRFKFzsMDVaLXJZ5xo++X/j\n/qNGrn4Vadble4eCy/HYNpkSb67IWhjtr0TtnH/Hrfr9j4yIbuioMuAF4Bx/E55x\ng++kt5gem9FDO4GRdOduGXjpgWY2W/iPuhvC+1DIQq5GNkJTceGKbFNEwRsrX9uF\nUsLPVCgqF+VOqYh8zyLGEY8HqmhzB1udRxb7dnIqvfBgRlIlLQwdBkGqzILYeusI\nIHWAaK/F4KlJp4ksep2+18RdGkkl90/i4FJtgWpX59M/Jc7FioL5NavF9+lsJxM2\nOy5SzDpw5JoNIDHy6zBD+NF6NRFpggWiWOYjyLxY3RWLXjd1Rj9D+ftWAoz+d/6e\nK+MJy0JpLyrF2xqtxLoE\n=isDR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c2974ff41ae44d04e9de9cd78b6bb9674d462673\nparent b9461b11b39e9b44636ca7a98c78ea5a9b786b3a\nauthor Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com> 1788874946 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788874946 +0700\n\nchore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:42:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-code-quality-skills/commits/0b9a1eaa83ca2ad9b2c895741648e7cde10f6189","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-code-quality-skills/commit/0b9a1eaa83ca2ad9b2c895741648e7cde10f6189","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-code-quality-skills/commits/0b9a1eaa83ca2ad9b2c895741648e7cde10f6189/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gra